      "usage": "Secondary action: underlined condensed caps with a sliding arrow. Use beneath the primary CTA (e.g. Get directions under Order now). With target=\"_blank\" it adds rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" automatically so Firefox COOP cannot block the new tab.",
      "examples": [
